      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu atwiluki nawu tuyakwakukalakela Kristu, tuyatulama ansaŋu jaNzambi jakujinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu akuhwelelaŋa atulama nawu chiŋa ayimoni kushinshika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunsompesha kudenu hela kudi antu acheŋi, hichuma chakuhemesha hohu; eŋaŋi, hela ami aweni hinadisompeshaŋaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa ami hineluki chuma chakudinka nachu muloŋaku; hela chochu, hidichi chinayiŋiluku; Mwanta diyi wansompeshaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi bayi munyakala kusompeshaku, chiŋa Mwanta nenzi; yena diyi wakaleta yuma yakujinda yamumwidima kuchejeji, wakamwekesha niyitoŋojoka yamuchima. Henohu dihu hakamonawu antu ejima kuyihameka kudi Nzambi, hamuntu hamuntu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu ana kwetu, yumiyi nayibalumuni kufwikŋa nachu chituneli ninami niApolosi hansaŋu yenu, kulonda mwilukili kudetu mubuli kupandakana yuma yasonekawu dehi munyikanda yajila; kulonda mukachi kenu mubuli kwikala muntu wukulemesha wumu asekesha mukwawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinyi nakwili nindi wunabadiki mukwenu? Chuma chiwukweti chiwunabuli kutambula chumanyi? Indi neyi wachitambwili wukudisambiladi, neyi hiwachitambwiluku?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munekuti dehi, muneli dehi akwakuheta, munadyi dehi wanta chakubula etu. Eŋaŋi, nakeŋi nami muyuli, kulonda ninetu tuyuli hamu nanenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyi yuma yinayisonekeli, hinayisonekeli nami niyitiyisha nachu nsonyuku, nalondi kuyikonkomwena, nanichi chimuneli muyanyanami nakeŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela mukweti ikumi damakombakaji dawankuluŋaŋa amudi Kristu, himukweti atata amavuluku; muloŋa ami nayivweleli mudi Kristu Yesu nansanu yayiwahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi nayilembeleli nami ikalenu akwakuŋi mbujola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dihu hanafumi kuyitemeshela Timotewu, himwanami nakeŋa wamudi Mwanta, washinshika; diyi wakayanukisha munelaŋa mudi Kristu, mwomunalejelaŋa kwejima muyipompelu yejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa enu amakwawu munadinki dehi wanta, nenu ami hinakenza kudenuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuleha chanti nakenza kudenu, neyi Nzambi neteji. Dihu hinakeluka Ŋovu jawenowu anadinki wanta, bayi mazu awu hohuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa wanta waNzambi walemenaŋa kuŊovu, bayi kumazuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munakeŋidi? Ninzi kudenu nakabama, tahindi nakukeŋa naspiritu yakudizoza?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.4.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
